{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 TT Theme Font Editor\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Find and change the font sizes of the active REAPER theme.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Picker: hover over any text in the REAPER window, click or press Shift to lock it. The editor shows which WALTER font (or ini font) is used there.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change size, bold and italic; element overrides give single WALTER elements a font of their own.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Changes are previewed live through a working copy; "Bake theme" writes a new theme {\f1 <Name> (TimTechlor)}. The original theme stays untouched.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Requires ReaImGui (0.10+) and js_ReaScriptAPI (both in ReaTeam Extensions). Manual: TT_ThemeFontEditor_Manual.html next to the script.\par}
}
